      "title": "Thin Transport",
      "items": [
        "The client streams the scanner cross-origin; there is no same-origin proxy",
        "Frames are versioned NDJSON: meta, progress, trace, then one terminal frame",
        "The site renders the terminal report in place instead of navigating"
